        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:23px&quot;&gt;Seven machine steps. Three human decisions. Three failures they exist to catch.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#cbd5e1&quot;&gt;The agent runs the column on the left end to end. A person only enters where the amber arrows do.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#0f172a;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;spacingLeft=22;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
